<second_data>
To make the billing fields of city and postcode not required and hidden when Cyprus is selected as the country in the WooCommerce checkout, you can use the following code snippet:

```php
add_filter( 'woocommerce_billing_fields', 'custom_billing_fields_cyprus', 10, 1 );
function custom_billing_fields_cyprus( $fields ) {
    // Check if Cyprus is selected as the country
    if ( isset( $_POST['billing_country'] ) && $_POST['billing_country'] === 'CY' ) {
        // Make city and postcode fields not required
        $fields['billing_city']['required'] = false;
        $fields['billing_postcode']['required'] = false;

        // Hide city and postcode fields
        $fields['billing_city']['hidden'] = true;
        $fields['billing_postcode']['hidden'] = true;
    }

    return $fields;
}
```

